  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 55 (Monday, March 27, 2023)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. WILLIAMS of Texas:\nH.R. 1817.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, Section 8, clause 18 of the U.S. Constitution\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nProhibits estimation of a borrower's race or ethnicity by\nvisual observation or last name.\n[Page H1465]\n</pre>",
